 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 09\/02\/2027 (+10.00 \u20ac almo\u00e7o opcional))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, hora e local do Aldeias Douro Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Aldeias Douro Trail 2027 realiza-se no domingo, dia 14 de fevereiro de 2027, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09:00 na freguesia de Aldeias, concelho de Armamar, distrito de Viseu.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as provas e os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento compreende tr\u00eas vertentes com inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abertas at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de 9 de fevereiro de 2027: Trail Longo (21 km) por 15,00 \u20ac, Trail Curto por 12,00 \u20ac e Caminhada por 10,00 \u20ac. Os participantes podem ainda adquirir almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio opcional por 10,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O regulamento detalhado e a altimetria de 2027 j\u00e1 est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A data oficial (14 de fevereiro de 2027 \u00e0s 09:00), as vertentes e a tabela de pre\u00e7os j\u00e1 est\u00e3o confirmadas na plataforma oficial de inscri\u00e7\u00f5es. O regulamento completo em PDF e os perfis altim\u00e9tricos detalhados ser\u00e3o atualizados nesta p\u00e1gina assim que disponibilizados pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Aldeias Douro Trail?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 promovido pela Junta de Freguesia de Aldeias, no munic\u00edpio de Armamar, visando dinamizar o desporto na natureza e dar a conhecer o patrim\u00f3nio rural e paisag\u00edstico da freguesia.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os resultados e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Ap\u00f3s a realiza\u00e7\u00e3o do Aldeias Douro Trail a 14 de fevereiro de 2027, os resultados e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es do Trail Longo e do Trail Curto poder\u00e3o ser consultados no portal Portugal Running.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Aldeias Douro Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-14\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Aldeias, Armamar\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Armamar\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Aldeias Douro Trail 2027 realiza-se a 14 de fevereiro em Aldeias, Armamar (Viseu), com Trail Longo 21 km, Trail Curto e Caminhada. Garante j\u00e1 o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/aldeias-douro-trail-2027.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo \u2013 21 km\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/4540\/info\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.p